db/migrations/meta/_journal.json.bak

# The repo-root /build directory is product SPECS (00-…16-…md), not build
# output. The `build/` and `**/build/` rules above are for Flutter/Node
# artefacts and would otherwise silently exclude every spec in the project.
# These negations must stay at the end of the file — later rules win.
!/build/
!/build/*.md
